# Document language

**Every project document is English only, always.**

This covers `.md`, `.mdc`, task cards, READMEs, agent profiles, trial
narrative reports, and `DOCS.md`. Do not add a Russian (or any other)
document for a new rule, card, baseline note, or report.

Chat with Yury stays Russian. Files on this disk do not.

Class names and Unity API stay untranslated: `FixedUpdate`, `Rigidbody2D`,
`HingeJoint2D`. Metric names stay as in JSON (`fell`, `pelvisDrop`).

When editing a file that still has Russian, translate that file in the
same change. Do not leave a mixed-language living document.

Do not delete old tables to "clean up" a translation. Translate them.
C# comments already in the tree are not this pass; new comments in files
you touch should be English.
